acceptance_criteria: Every corrected declaration accurately describes runtime behavior; the canonical docstring gate scans every executable TypeScript source; unresolvable entry paths fail closed; typecheck and docstring gates pass; the merged PR has green CI and substantive reviewers
resolution: Canonical docstring gate and corrected documentation merged in PR #84.
expected_result: Every executable TypeScript declaration is documented accurately and the mandatory gate cannot silently skip an unresolvable invocation.
actual_result: "Merged PR #84 corrected the eight documented source areas, hardened the entry guard, and added nine focused gate tests. Current npm run docstring reports 77 files and 519 documented declarations; PR #84 Node 22/26, Greptile, CodeRabbit and Hound checks passed."
